<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Noldan π gacha — Kuvonch Academy</title>
<meta name="description" content="Noldan π gacha — sanashdan oliy matematikagacha 11 ta kurs, 90 ta mavzu va har safar yangilanadigan mavzuli testlar. Kuvonch Academy.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://quvonchbek99.github.io/quvnoqdombogchalar/noldan-pigacha.html">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Kuvonch Academy">
<meta property="og:locale" content="uz_UZ">
<meta property="og:title" content="Noldan π gacha — Kuvonch Academy">
<meta property="og:description" content="11 ta kurs, 90 ta mavzu, cheksiz mavzuli test. Har safar yangi savollar.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://quvonchbek99.github.io/quvnoqdombogchalar/og-image.jpg">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#5ee6c7">
<link rel="icon" href="icon-192.png">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0b1220;--bg-soft:#111a2e;--card:#141f38;--border:#243252;--text:#eef2ff;--text-dim:#9fb0d0;--accent:#5ee6c7;--accent-2:#7c9bff;--bad:#ff8585;--good:#5ee6c7}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%,#16213f 0%,var(--bg) 55%);color:var(--text);
 font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.55;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
a{color:var(--accent)}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 80px}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
 background:rgba(11,18,32,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
 margin:0 -20px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text);flex:0 0 auto}
.brand b{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6a5af9,#8b5cf6);width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:16px}
nav{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;min-width:0}
nav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
nav a{color:var(--text-dim);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;white-space:nowrap}
nav a:hover,nav a.cur{color:var(--text);background:var(--bg-soft)}
.hero{padding:26px 0 10px}
.kicker{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
h1{font-size:34px;line-height:1.15;margin:8px 0 10px}
h1 span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.lead{color:var(--text-dim);max-width:700px;margin:0 0 14px}
.stats{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0 6px}
.stat{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;min-width:96px}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:20px}
.stat span{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-dim)}
.toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:18px 0 6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.toolbar input{flex:1;min-width:200px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);
 border-radius:12px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:15px;outline:none}
.toolbar input:focus{border-color:var(--accent-2)}
.btn{border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 16px;
 font:700 14px/1 inherit;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.btn.pri{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6a5af9,#8b5cf6);border-color:transparent;color:#fff}
.btn.acc{background:var(--accent);border-color:transparent;color:#07261f}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}
.courses{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:14px}
.course{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.course::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:4px;background:var(--cc,#7c9bff)}
.chead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.cico{width:44px;height:44px;flex:0 0 44px;border-radius:13px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:21px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cc) 18%,transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--cc) 40%,transparent)}
.chead h2{margin:0;font-size:19px}
.chead .sub{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;margin-top:2px}
.ring{margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.ring .pct{font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--cc)}
.ring .arw{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14px;transition:transform .2s}
.course.open .ring .arw{transform:rotate(90deg)}
.bar{height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--bg-soft);margin-top:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cc),var(--accent));width:0}
.units{display:none;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.course.open .units{display:grid}
.unit{text-align:left;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 12px;
 cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);font:600 14px/1.3 inherit;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-width:0}
.unit:hover{border-color:var(--cc)}
.unit .n{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.unit .m{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--border);color:var(--text-dim)}
.unit .m.ok{background:rgba(94,230,199,.16);color:var(--accent)}
.unit .m.mid{background:rgba(250,204,21,.16);color:#facc15}
.empty{color:var(--text-dim);padding:20px 2px}
/* ---- Modal ---- */
.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(5,9,18,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);z-index:900;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}
.ov.on{display:flex}
.modal{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;max-width:440px;width:100%;padding:20px;max-height:90vh;overflow:auto}
.modal h3{margin:4px 0 4px;font-size:20px}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-2)}
.meta{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;margin:10px 0 14px}
.levels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin:12px 0}
.lv{background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;padding:11px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);font:700 14px/1.2 inherit;text-align:left}
.lv small{display:block;color:var(--text-dim);font-weight:600;font-size:12px;margin-top:3px}
.lv[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(94,230,199,.1)}
.note{background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim);margin:10px 0}
.row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.row .btn{flex:1}
/* ---- Test ---- */
.test{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:950;background:var(--bg);display:none;flex-direction:column}
.test.on{display:flex}
.thead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex:0 0 auto}
.thead .tt{font-weight:800;font-size:15px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex:1;min-width:0}
.thead .cnt{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;flex:0 0 auto}
.tprog{height:4px;background:var(--bg-soft);flex:0 0 auto}
.tprog i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));width:0;transition:width .25s}
.tbody{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;padding:18px 14px 110px}
.tinner{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto}
.q{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;white-space:pre-wrap}
.opts{display:grid;gap:9px}
.opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;
 padding:13px 14px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);font:600 16px/1.3 inherit;text-align:left;width:100%}
.opt .k{flex:0 0 26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text-dim)}
.opt[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--accent-2);background:rgba(124,155,255,.12)}
.opt.ok{border-color:var(--good);background:rgba(94,230,199,.13)}
.opt.no{border-color:var(--bad);background:rgba(255,133,133,.12)}
.opt:disabled{cursor:default}
.sol{margin-top:12px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-dim);display:none}
.sol.on{display:block}
.sol b{color:var(--text)}
.tfoot{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(11,18,32,.95);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-top:1px solid var(--border);
 padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:9px;z-index:2}
.tfoot .in{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:9px;width:100%}
.tfoot .btn{flex:1}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--bad);border-color:rgba(255,133,133,.4)}
/* ---- Natija ---- */
.res{text-align:center;padding:10px 0}
.res .big{font-size:52px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 4px}
.res .lbl{color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:16px}
.res .xp{display:inline-block;background:rgba(94,230,199,.14);color:var(--accent);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 14px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}
.review{text-align:left;margin-top:20px;display:grid;gap:8px}
.rv{background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--bad);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:14px}
.rv .a1{color:var(--bad)}.rv .a2{color:var(--good);font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:620px){h1{font-size:26px}.levels{grid-template-columns:1fr}.chead h2{font-size:17px}}
#np-bank{display:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header>
  <a class="brand" href="index.html"><b>π</b> Kuvonch Academy</a>
  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Bosh sahifa</a>
    <a href="noldan-pigacha.html" class="cur">π Noldan π gacha</a>
    <a href="mashqlar.html">Mashqlar</a>
    <a href="virtual.html">🖐 Virtual</a>
    <a href="chempionat.html">🏆 Chempionat</a>
    <a href="jamoa.html">👥 Jamoa</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <span class="kicker">To'liq o'quv yo'li</span>
  <h1>Noldan <span>π gacha</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Sanashdan boshlab oliy matematikagacha — 11 ta kurs, 90 ta mavzu.
  Har bir mavzuda mavzuli test bor: savollarning qolipi bir xil qoladi, sonlar esa har safar yangidan tanlanadi,
  shuning uchun test hech qachon takrorlanmaydi va yodlab bo'lmaydi.</p>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><b id="s-kurs">11</b><span>kurs</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b id="s-mavzu">90</b><span>mavzu</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b id="s-xp">0</b><span>XP</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b id="s-pct">0%</b><span>o'zlashtirish</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar">
    <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Mavzu qidirish: kasrlar, logarifm, vektor…" autocomplete="off">
    <button class="btn" id="btn-cont" style="display:none"></button>
    <button class="btn" id="btn-rand">🎲 Tasodifiy mavzu</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="courses" id="courses"></div>
<p class="empty" id="nores" style="display:none">Bunday mavzu topilmadi.</p>
</div>

<!-- Mavzu oynasi -->
<div class="ov" id="ov">
  <div class="modal">
    <span class="tag" id="m-kurs"></span>
    <h3 id="m-title"></h3>
    <div class="meta" id="m-meta"></div>
    <div class="levels" id="m-levels"></div>
    <div class="note">⭐ Har bir to'g'ri javob uchun <b>2 XP</b>. Savollar har safar yangidan yaratiladi.</div>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="btn" id="m-close">← Ortga</button>
      <button class="btn pri" id="m-start">Boshlash →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Test -->
<div class="test" id="test">
  <div class="thead">
    <button class="btn" id="t-exit" style="padding:8px 12px">✕</button>
    <div class="tt" id="t-title"></div>
    <div class="cnt" id="t-cnt"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="tprog"><i id="t-bar"></i></div>
  <div class="tbody"><div class="tinner" id="t-inner"></div></div>
  <div class="tfoot" id="t-foot"><div class="in">
    <button class="btn ghost" id="t-fin">Yakunlash</button>
    <button class="btn acc" id="t-next" disabled>Tekshirish</button>
  </div></div>
</div>

